# Diagnostic build: Wi-Fi capture with the 802.15.4 stack excluded entirely.
# Tests whether coexistence between the two radios is what stops Wi-Fi
# delivering frames (ESP-IDF issue #18838, "Wifi stuck when coexisting with
# 15.4"). Our own instrumentation showed the promiscuous callback firing
# exactly zero times with both compiled in.
CONFIG_IEEE802154_ENABLED=n
